  "summary_text": "Timeout settings and test fixtures and ci pipeline\nTimeout settings is in a weird spot\nTest fixtures is good enough for now\nReal issue may be staging deploy rather than ci pipeline\nNo clear owner for ci pipeline\nDeploy freeze and load test and open questions\nDeploy freeze and load test seen as one underlying problem\nNotes on load test added to the doc\nNotes on open questions added to the doc\nSchema migration and tradeoffs and webhook handler\nSchema migration is mostly fine\nTradeoffs is way overdue\nNotes on webhook handler added to the doc\nIncident review and dependency upgrade and process\nIncident review is in good shape\nReal issue may be feature flag cleanup rather than dependency upgrade\nProcess and test fixtures seen as one underlying problem\nProgress updates\nDone: triage the flaky end-to-end tests (Ruth)\nSlipped: clean up the settings page (Megan, now due Wednesday)\nNext steps\nKofi to write the churn cohort query by Wednesday\nTomás to upgrade the Postgres cluster by Wednesday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Timeout settings and test fixtures and ci pipeline\n- Timeout settings is in a weird spot\n- Test fixtures is good enough for now\n- Real issue may be staging deploy rather than ci pipeline\n  - No clear owner for ci pipeline\n\n### Deploy freeze and load test and open questions\n- Deploy freeze and load test seen as one underlying problem\n- Notes on load test added to the doc\n- Notes on open questions added to the doc\n\n### Schema migration and tradeoffs and webhook handler\n- Schema migration is mostly fine\n- Tradeoffs is way overdue\n- Notes on webhook handler added to the doc\n\n### Incident review and dependency upgrade and process\n- Incident review is in good shape\n- Real issue may be feature flag cleanup rather than dependency upgrade\n- Process and test fixtures seen as one underlying problem\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** triage the flaky end-to-end tests (Ruth)\n- **Slipped:** clean up the settings page (Megan, now due Wednesday)\n\n### Next steps\n- Kofi to write the churn cohort query by **Wednesday**\n- Tomás to upgrade the Postgres cluster by **Wednesday**",
